const resourceDefs={departments:{description:'Organize academic departments and their operational ownership.',fields:[['name','Department name','text'],['code','Department code','text'],['description','Description','textarea']],columns:[{key:'name',label:'Department'},{key:'code',label:'Code'},{key:'description',label:'Description'},{key:'isActive',label:'Status',render:v=><Status value={v?'ACTIVE':'INACTIVE'}/>}],initial:{name:'',code:'',description:''}},committees:{description:'Manage institutional committees and their responsibilities.',fields:[['name','Committee name','text'],['code','Committee code','text'],['description','Description','textarea'],['headId','Committee head user ID','text']],columns:[{key:'name',label:'Committee'},{key:'code',label:'Code'},{key:'description',label:'Description'},{key:'isActive',label:'Status',render:v=><Status value={v?'ACTIVE':'INACTIVE'}/>}],initial:{name:'',code:'',description:'',headId:'',memberIds:[]}},'academic-years':{description:'Maintain academic-year boundaries and the currently active year.',fields:[['name','Academic year name','text'],['startDate','Start date','date'],['endDate','End date','date']],columns:[{key:'name',label:'Academic year'},{key:'startDate',label:'Starts',render:v=>dateLabel(v)},{key:'endDate',label:'Ends',render:v=>dateLabel(v)},{key:'isActive',label:'Status',render:v=><Status value={v?'ACTIVE':'INACTIVE'}/>}],initial:{name:'',startDate:'',endDate:''}}};
export function ResourcePage({resource,title}){const {user}=useAuth();const canManage=['DIRECTOR','PRINCIPAL','ADMIN'].includes(user?.role);const def=resourceDefs[resource];const [rows,setRows]=useState([]),[loading,setLoading]=useState(true),[error,setError]=useState(''),[search,setSearch]=useState(''),[modal,setModal]=useState(false),[form,setForm]=useState(def.initial),[formError,setFormError]=useState(''),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false);async function load(){setLoading(true);setError('');try{const r=await list(`/${resource}`,{page:1,limit:100});setRows(Array.isArray(r.data)?r.data:[]);}catch(e){setError(message(e));}finally{setLoading(false);}}useEffect(()=>{load();},[resource]);async function save(e){e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);setFormError('');const payload={...form};if(resource==='academic-years'){payload.startDate=new Date(form.startDate).toISOString();payload.endDate=new Date(form.endDate).toISOString();}try{await post(`/${resource}`,payload);setModal(false);await load();}catch(e){setFormError(message(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}}async function activate(row){try{if(resource==='academic-years')await post(`/academic-years/${idOf(row)}/activate`,{});else await patch(`/${resource}/${idOf(row)}`,{isActive:!row.isActive});await load();}catch(e){setError(message(e));}}const filtered=rows.filter(r=>Object.values(r).some(v=>String(v&&typeof v==='object'?v.name||'':v??'').toLowerCase().includes(search.toLowerCase())));return <div className="page-stack"><PageHeader eyebrow="INSTITUTION SETUP" title={title} description={def.description} action={canManage&&<button className="btn primary" onClick={()=>{setForm(def.initial);setFormError('');setModal(true);}}><Plus size={17}/> Add {resource==='academic-years'?'academic year':resource==='departments'?'department':'committee'}</button>}/><section className="panel"><div className="toolbar"><div className="search-box"><Search size={16}/><input placeholder={`Search ${title.toLowerCase()}…`} value={search} onChange={e=>setSearch(e.target.value)}/></div><span className="count">{filtered.length} records</span></div>{loading?<Loading/>:error?<ErrorState error={error} retry={load}/>:<Table rows={filtered} columns={canManage?[...def.columns,{key:'id',label:'Action',render:(_v,r)=><button className="btn secondary small" disabled={resource==='academic-years'&&(r.isActive||r.isArchived)} onClick={()=>activate(r)}>{resource==='academic-years'&&r.isActive?'Active':r.isActive?'Deactivate':'Activate'}</button>}]:def.columns}/>}</section>{modal&&<Modal title={`Add ${resource==='academic-years'?'academic year':resource==='departments'?'department':'committee'}`} onClose={()=>setModal(false)}><form className="form-grid" onSubmit={save}>{def.fields.map(([k,l,t])=><Field key={k} label={l} name={k} type={t==='date'?'date':undefined} as={t==='textarea'?'textarea':'input'} value={form[k]||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,[k]:e.target.value})} required maxLength={t==='textarea'?2000:120}/>)}{formError&&<div className="form-wide"><Notice text={formError}/></div>}<div className="form-actions form-wide"><button type="button" className="btn secondary" onClick={()=>setModal(false)}>Cancel</button><button className="btn primary" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Saving…':'Create record'}</button></div></form></Modal>}</div>;}

export function UsersPage(){
 const [rows,setRows]=useState([]),[loading,setLoading]=useState(true),[error,setError]=useState(''),[search,setSearch]=useState(''),[filterRole,setFilterRole]=useState(''),[modal,setModal]=useState(false),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[formError,setFormError]=useState(''),[form,setForm]=useState({name:'',email:'',password:'',role:'FACULTY'});
 const roles=['DIRECTOR','PRINCIPAL','HOD','COMMITTEE_HEAD','FACULTY','ADMIN'];
 async function load(){setLoading(true);setError('');try{const r=await list('/users',{page:1,limit:100,...(filterRole?{role:filterRole}:{})});setRows(Array.isArray(r.data)?r.data:[]);}catch(e){setError(message(e));}finally{setLoading(false);}}
 useEffect(()=>{load();},[filterRole]);
 const filtered=rows.filter(u=>`${u.name} ${u.email} ${u.role}`.toLowerCase().includes(search.toLowerCase()));
 async function create(e){e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);setFormError('');try{await post('/users',form);setModal(false);setForm({name:'',email:'',password:'',role:'FACULTY'});await load();}catch(e){setFormError(message(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}}
 async function toggle(r){try{await patch(`/users/${idOf(r)}/status`,{isActive:!r.isActive});await load();}catch(e){setError(message(e));}}
 async function roleChange(r,role){try{await patch(`/users/${idOf(r)}/role`,{role});await load();}catch(e){setError(message(e));}}
 const set=k=>e=>setForm({...form,[k]:e.target.value});
 const columns=[
  {key:'name',label:'User',render:(v,r)=><div className="user-cell"><span className="avatar small-avatar">{(v||'U').split(' ').map(x=>x[0]).slice(0,2).join('').toUpperCase()}</span><div><b>{v}</b><small>{r.email}</small></div></div>},
  {key:'role',label:'Role',render:(v,r)=><select className="role-select" value={v} aria-label={`Role for ${r.name}`} onChange={e=>roleChange(r,e.target.value)}>{roles.map(role=><option key={role} value={role}>{titleCase(role)}</option>)}</select>},
  {key:'isActive',label:'Access',render:v=><Status value={v?'ACTIVE':'INACTIVE'}/>},
  {key:'lastLoginAt',label:'Last sign in',render:v=>v?dateLabel(v):'Never'},
  {key:'id',label:'Action',render:(_v,r)=><button className="btn secondary small" onClick={()=>toggle(r)}>{r.isActive?'Deactivate':'Activate'}</button>}
 ];
 return <div className="page-stack">
  <PageHeader eyebrow="ADMINISTRATION" title="User administration" description="Manage accounts, roles and active access for the institute ERP." action={<button className="btn primary" onClick={()=>{setFormError('');setModal(true);}}><UserPlus size={17}/> Add user</button>}/>
  <section className="panel"><div className="toolbar"><div className="search-box"><Search size={16}/><input placeholder="Search name or email…" value={search} onChange={e=>setSearch(e.target.value)}/></div><select aria-label="Filter role" value={filterRole} onChange={e=>setFilterRole(e.target.value)}><option value="">All roles</option>{roles.map(r=><option key={r} value={r}>{titleCase(r)}</option>)}</select><span className="count">{filtered.length} users</span></div>{loading?<Loading label="Loading user accounts…"/>:error?<ErrorState error={error} retry={load}/>:<Table rows={filtered} columns={columns}/>}</section>
  {modal&&<Modal title="Create user" subtitle="Use a strong initial password and share it securely." onClose={()=>setModal(false)}><form className="form-grid" onSubmit={create}><Field label="Full name" name="name" value={form.name} onChange={set('name')} required minLength={2}/><Field label="Email" name="email" type="email" value={form.email} onChange={set('email')} required/><Field label="Initial password" name="password" type="password" value={form.password} onChange={set('password')} required minLength={12}/><Field label="Primary role" name="role" as="select" value={form.role} onChange={set('role')} options={roles.map(r=>({value:r,label:titleCase(r)}))}/>{formError&&<div className="form-wide"><Notice text={formError}/></div>}<div className="form-actions form-wide"><button type="button" className="btn secondary" onClick={()=>setModal(false)}>Cancel</button><button className="btn primary" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Creating…':'Create account'}</button></div></form></Modal>}
 </div>;
}

export function CompliancePage(){const {user}=useAuth();const [criteria,setCriteria]=useState([]),[mappings,setMappings]=useState([]),[completeness,setCompleteness]=useState(null),[activities,setActivities]=useState([]),[evidence,setEvidence]=useState([]),[loading,setLoading]=useState(true),[error,setError]=useState(''),[modal,setModal]=useState(''),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[formError,setFormError]=useState(''),[criterion,setCriterion]=useState({framework:'NAAC',criterionCode:'',title:'',description:'',requiredEvidenceTypes:''}),[mapping,setMapping]=useState({criterionId:'',activityId:'',evidenceId:''});const canManage=['DIRECTOR','PRINCIPAL','ADMIN'].includes(user?.role);async function load(){setLoading(true);setError('');try{const [c,m,co,a,e]=await Promise.all([list('/compliance/criteria',{page:1,limit:100}),list('/compliance/mappings',{page:1,limit:100}),get('/compliance/completeness'),list('/activities',{limit:100}),list('/evidence',{limit:100})]);setCriteria(Array.isArray(c.data)?c.data:[]);setMappings(Array.isArray(m.data)?m.data:[]);setCompleteness(co);setActivities(Array.isArray(a.data)?a.data:[]);setEvidence(Array.isArray(e.data)?e.data:[]);}catch(e){setError(message(e));}finally{setLoading(false);}}useEffect(()=>{load();},[]);async function saveCriterion(e){e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);setFormError('');try{await post('/compliance/criteria',{...criterion,requiredEvidenceTypes:criterion.requiredEvidenceTypes.split(',').map(v=>v.trim()).filter(Boolean)});setModal('');await load();}catch(e){setFormError(message(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}}async function saveMapping(e){e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);setFormError('');try{await post('/compliance/mappings',{criterionId:mapping.criterionId,activityId:mapping.activityId,evidenceId:mapping.evidenceId||null});setModal('');await load();}catch(e){setFormError(message(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}}async function review(r,reviewStatus){const reviewComment=prompt(`${titleCase(reviewStatus)} comment (optional):`)||'';try{await post(`/compliance/mappings/${idOf(r)}/review`,{reviewStatus,reviewComment});await load();}catch(e){setError(message(e));}}return <div className="page-stack"><PageHeader eyebrow="QUALITY ASSURANCE" title="Compliance & evidence mapping" description="Map activity evidence to NBA, NAAC and IQAC criteria, and track review readiness." action={<div className="header-actions">{canManage&&<button className="btn secondary" onClick={()=>setModal('criterion')}><Plus size={16}/> Add criterion</button>}{['DIRECTOR','PRINCIPAL','HOD','COMMITTEE_HEAD','ADMIN'].includes(user?.role)&&<button className="btn primary" onClick={()=>setModal('mapping')}><FileCheck2 size={16}/> Map evidence</button>}</div>}/>{loading?<Loading label="Loading compliance data…"/>:error?<ErrorState error={error} retry={load}/>:<><div className="metric-grid">{[['Criteria configured',criteria.length,ShieldCheck,'blue'],['Evidence mappings',mappings.length,FileCheck2,'teal'],['Pending review',mappings.filter(m=>m.reviewStatus==='PENDING').length,Clock3,'amber'],['Completeness',Array.isArray(completeness)&&completeness.length?`${Math.round(completeness.reduce((sum,row)=>sum+(Number(row.completenessPercent)||0),0)/completeness.length)}%`:'—',Check,'violet']].map(([t,v,I,c])=><div className="metric-card" key={t}><div className={`metric-icon ${c}`}><I size={20}/></div><span>{t}</span><strong>{v}</strong></div>)}</div><section className="panel"><div className="panel-heading"><div><h2>Compliance criteria</h2><p>Configured frameworks and evidence expectations</p></div></div><Table rows={criteria} columns={[{key:'framework',label:'Framework',render:v=><span className="framework-chip">{v}</span>},{key:'criterionCode',label:'Criterion code'},{key:'title',label:'Criterion'},{key:'requiredEvidenceTypes',label:'Required evidence',render:v=>(v||[]).join(', ')||'—'},{key:'isActive',label:'Status',render:v=><Status value={v?'ACTIVE':'INACTIVE'}/>} ]}/></section><section className="panel"><div className="panel-heading"><div><h2>Evidence mappings</h2><p>Review whether mapped evidence is accepted for a criterion</p></div></div><Table rows={mappings} columns={[{key:'criterionId',label:'Criterion',render:v=>criteria.find(c=>idOf(c)===idOf(v))?.title||label(v)},{key:'activityId',label:'Activity',render:v=>activities.find(a=>idOf(a)===idOf(v))?.title||label(v)},{key:'evidenceId',label:'Evidence',render:v=>evidence.find(e=>idOf(e)===idOf(v))?.originalName||label(v)},{key:'reviewStatus',label:'Review status',render:v=><Status value={v}/>},{key:'id',label:'Review',render:(_v,r)=>r.reviewStatus==='PENDING'&&['DIRECTOR','PRINCIPAL','HOD','COMMITTEE_HEAD','ADMIN'].includes(user?.role)?<div className="row-actions"><button className="btn secondary small" onClick={()=>review(r,'ACCEPTED')}>Accept</button><button className="btn danger small" onClick={()=>review(r,'REJECTED')}>Reject</button></div>:'—'}]}/></section></>}{modal==='criterion'&&<Modal title="Add compliance criterion" onClose={()=>setModal('')}><form className="form-grid" onSubmit={saveCriterion}><Field label="Framework" name="framework" as="select" value={criterion.framework} onChange={e=>setCriterion({...criterion,framework:e.target.value})} options={['NBA','NAAC','IQAC'].map(v=>({value:v,label:v}))}/><Field label="Criterion code" name="criterionCode" value={criterion.criterionCode} onChange={e=>setCriterion({...criterion,criterionCode:e.target.value})} required/><Field label="Title" name="title" value={criterion.title} onChange={e=>setCriterion({...criterion,title:e.target.value})} required/><Field label="Required evidence types" name="requiredEvidenceTypes" value={criterion.requiredEvidenceTypes} onChange={e=>setCriterion({...criterion,requiredEvidenceTypes:e.target.value})} hint="Separate types with commas."/><Field label="Description" name="description" as="textarea" value={criterion.description} onChange={e=>setCriterion({...criterion,description:e.target.value})}/>{formError&&<div className="form-wide"><Notice text={formError}/></div>}<div className="form-actions form-wide"><button type="button" className="btn secondary" onClick={()=>setModal('')}>Cancel</button><button className="btn primary" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Saving…':'Create criterion'}</button></div></form></Modal>}{modal==='mapping'&&<Modal title="Map evidence to criterion" onClose={()=>setModal('')}><form className="form-grid" onSubmit={saveMapping}><Field label="Criterion" name="criterionId" as="select" value={mapping.criterionId} onChange={e=>setMapping({...mapping,criterionId:e.target.value})} required options={criteria.map(c=>({value:idOf(c),label:`${c.framework} · ${c.criterionCode} — ${c.title}`}))}/><Field label="Activity" name="activityId" as="select" value={mapping.activityId} onChange={e=>setMapping({...mapping,activityId:e.target.value})} required options={activities.map(a=>({value:idOf(a),label:a.title}))}/><Field label="Evidence item (optional)" name="evidenceId" as="select" value={mapping.evidenceId} onChange={e=>setMapping({...mapping,evidenceId:e.target.value})} options={evidence.map(v=>({value:idOf(v),label:v.originalName}))}/>{formError&&<div className="form-wide"><Notice text={formError}/></div>}<div className="form-actions form-wide"><button type="button" className="btn secondary" onClick={()=>setModal('')}>Cancel</button><button className="btn primary" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Saving…':'Create mapping'}</button></div></form></Modal>}</div>;}

export function AuditPage(){const [rows,setRows]=useState([]),[loading,setLoading]=useState(true),[error,setError]=useState('');async function load(){setLoading(true);setError('');try{const r=await list('/audit-logs',{page:1,limit:100});setRows(Array.isArray(r.data)?r.data:[]);}catch(e){setError(message(e));}finally{setLoading(false);}}useEffect(()=>{load();},[]);return <div className="page-stack"><PageHeader eyebrow="SECURITY & ACCOUNTABILITY" title="Audit trail" description="Review recorded actions for traceability and institutional accountability."/><section className="panel"><div className="panel-heading"><div><h2>Recent audit events</h2><p>Only records allowed by your role and scope are returned.</p></div><ShieldCheck size={20}/></div>{loading?<Loading label="Loading audit trail…"/>:error?<ErrorState error={error} retry={load}/>:<Table rows={rows} columns={[{key:'createdAt',label:'Timestamp',render:v=>dateLabel(v,{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'})},{key:'actorId',label:'Actor',render:v=>label(v)},{key:'action',label:'Action'},{key:'resourceType',label:'Resource'},{key:'resourceId',label:'Resource ID',render:v=>v?String(v).slice(-10):'—'},{key:'requestId',label:'Request ID'}]}/>}</section></div>;}

export function SettingsPage(){const {user}=useAuth();const [form,setForm]=useState({currentPassword:'',newPassword:'',confirmPassword:''}),[error,setError]=useState(''),[success,setSuccess]=useState(''),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false);async function submit(e){e.preventDefault();setError('');setSuccess('');if(form.newPassword.length<12){setError('New password must be at least 12 characters.');return;}if(form.newPassword!==form.confirmPassword){setError('New password and confirmation do not match.');return;}setBusy(true);try{await post('/auth/change-password',{currentPassword:form.currentPassword,newPassword:form.newPassword});setForm({currentPassword:'',newPassword:'',confirmPassword:''});setSuccess('Password changed successfully.');}catch(e){setError(message(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}}const initials=(user?.name||'U').split(' ').slice(0,2).map(v=>v[0]).join('').toUpperCase();return <div className="page-stack"><PageHeader eyebrow="PREFERENCES" title="Settings" description="Manage your account security and view your current access profile."/><div className="settings-grid"><section className="panel"><div className="panel-heading"><div><h2>Account profile</h2><p>Identity and role information</p></div></div><div className="profile-card"><span className="avatar large-avatar">{initials}</span><div><h3>{user?.name}</h3><p>{user?.email}</p><span className="framework-chip">{titleCase(user?.role)}</span></div></div><div className="setting-row"><span>Account status</span><Status value="ACTIVE"/></div><div className="setting-row"><span>Department memberships</span><b>{user?.departmentIds?.length||0}</b></div><div className="setting-row"><span>Committee memberships</span><b>{user?.committeeIds?.length||0}</b></div></section><section className="panel"><div className="panel-heading"><div><h2>Change password</h2><p>Choose a unique, strong password.</p></div></div><form className="settings-form" onSubmit={submit}><Field label="Current password" name="currentPassword" type="password" value={form.currentPassword} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,currentPassword:e.target.value})} required/><Field label="New password" name="newPassword" type="password" value={form.newPassword} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,newPassword:e.target.value})} required minLength={12} hint="At least 12 characters."/><Field label="Confirm new password" name="confirmPassword" type="password" value={form.confirmPassword} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,confirmPassword:e.target.value})} required/><p className="security-note"><ShieldCheck size={16}/> Never share your password. Administrators should not ask you to send it over chat or email.</p>{error&&<Notice text={error}/>}{success&&<Notice type="success" text={success}/>}<button className="btn primary" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Updating password…':'Update password'}</button></form></section></div></div>;}

export function NotFound(){return <div className="not-found"><span className="not-found-icon">◇</span><span className="eyebrow">404 · PAGE NOT FOUND</span><h1>This page isn't on the map.</h1><p>The address may have changed, or you may not have permission to access this page.</p><Link to="/" className="btn primary"><ArrowLeft size={16}/> Back to workspace</Link></div>;}
